{"4270020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Survival Quest Dungeons and the Beasts", "steam_appid": 4270020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure across the lands, collecting recipes, and crafting items to help your on your way. Build your home for when your not in battle. Fight through dungeons to find hidden treasures. Go on quests that in some cases can only be completed with the right items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine to smelt ores and build better items. Build your boat to sail across the water on the boat looking at the fish swimming below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more features to add as time goes on.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure across the lands, collecting recipes, and crafting items to help your on your way. Build your home for when your not in battle. Fight through dungeons to find hidden treasures. Go on quests that in some cases can only be completed with the right items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine to smelt ores and build better items. Build your boat to sail across the water on the boat looking at the fish swimming below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more features to add as time goes on.</p>", "short_description": "In a realm where you craft your way forward, hunt to survive, and cook your food to keep you from starving to death. You will go on many adventures. But along the way you will meet up with beasts that are constantly trying to take you out. Survive quests in Survival Quest Dungeons and the Beasts...", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270020/4fd088aa73e3ca8e878a2d4b6e7e542d1da468aa/header.jpg?t=1786054887", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270020/d4fa15d4a7d7dd6a1770b07eea541a9521039c7d/capsul